{"3440390": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Drunkard Simulator", "steam_appid": 3440390, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Multiplayer is included in Early Access. The demo is single-player only.</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Make Bad Choices Together!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Drunkard Simulator</strong> is an open-world sandbox game where you are the disaster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drink, stumble, steal, fight, crash things, and turn a quiet neighborhood into an unforgettable mess. Play solo, or bring your most questionable friends: the game is at its best when a group of maniacs turns every bad idea into a story nobody will remember tomorrow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world reacts to your actions, and with friends involved, even a simple trip to the store can become a drunken rooftop chase, a shopping-cart accident, or a barbecue-grill heist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Multiplayer Mayhem</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cause chaos together in online multiplayer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work as a team to survive the night, compete to see who can make the worst decisions, or immediately sabotage each other for no good reason. Drive badly, fight badly, fall over badly, and make every situation worse with your drinking buddies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A single player can make a mess. A group of drunkards can turn the whole town into a disaster zone.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440390/extras/755ec0bb6e3553d55eab2d5e3787bd54.poster.avif?t=1783867464\" width=1170 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440390/extras/755ec0bb6e3553d55eab2d5e3787bd54.webm?t=1783867464\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Sandbox Built for Chaos</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nearly everything is there to be used, moved, stolen, thrown, dragged, or crashed into something else.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carry a full barbecue grill down the street</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb rooftops</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Borrow a vehicle that definitely is not yours</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ride a stolen shopping cart straight into disaster</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn everyday objects into terrible plans</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you can lift it, drag it, throw it, drive it, or crash it, it is fair game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440390/extras/3cca80c01fd861570d63a3789877e190.poster.avif?t=1783867464\" width=1170 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440390/extras/3cca80c01fd861570d63a3789877e190.webm?t=1783867464\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Drink, Survive, Escalate</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drinking is not just cosmetic. It is a survival system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your blood alcohol level affects:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Movement</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Balance</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decision-making</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What ridiculous actions you can pull off</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The drunker you get, the more chaotic and capable you become—but staying upright gets harder. Push your limits, help your friends through their worst decisions, or watch them lose a fight against gravity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440390/extras/bae7a0dbecfd06c68604f0e52d693f79.poster.avif?t=1783867464\" width=1170 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440390/extras/bae7a0dbecfd06c68604f0e52d693f79.webm?t=1783867464\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Will You Become a Local Legend?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wreak havoc, pull off legendary stunts, drive drunk, brew moonshine, get into fights, make money, and make sure the locals never forget your group’s drunken adventures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab a virtual drink, invite your friends, stumble into the unknown, and make a glorious mess.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440390/extras/1528618aba4a207565662bf1cbed9759.poster.avif?t=1783867464\" width=1170 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440390/extras/1528618aba4a207565662bf1cbed9759.webm?t=1783867464\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><strong>Grab a (virtual) drink, stumble into the unknown, and make a glorious mess in the ultimate sandbox of drunken stupidity! </strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Online Multiplayer Mayhem</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fully Open Sandbox Map</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Drink, Stumble, Fight, Steal, and Smash</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BAC-Based Survival and Drunkenness Systems</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Physical Object Interaction</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character Customization</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Moonshine Brewing</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fist Fighting</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In-Game Economy</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Drunken Expressions and Ragdoll Chaos</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440390/extras/c626a3587d63c881c9c674cb0116e414.avif?t=1783867464\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440390/extras_big/c626a3587d63c881c9c674cb0116e414.avif?t=1783867464 width=800 height=74 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Multiplayer is included in Early Access. The demo is single-player only.</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Make Bad Choices Together!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Drunkard Simulator</strong> is an open-world sandbox game where you are the disaster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drink, stumble, steal, fight, crash things, and turn a quiet neighborhood into an unforgettable mess. Play solo, or bring your most questionable friends: the game is at its best when a group of maniacs turns every bad idea into a story nobody will remember tomorrow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world reacts to your actions, and with friends involved, even a simple trip to the store can become a drunken rooftop chase, a shopping-cart accident, or a barbecue-grill heist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Multiplayer Mayhem</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ca